WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: rw

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.020
Muraho, iyi ni Manner Code.

00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:05.350
Porogaramu iragoye

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:08.890
Mbere na mbere, hari kode nyinshi zigomba kwandikwa.

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:12.710
Urugero rw'imishinga nakoreye uru rukurikirane gusa

00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:15.270
Kode ifite imirongo irenga 12.000.

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:18.320
Niba ari serivisi ikora

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:21.530
Nubwo ari serivisi ntoya, byoroshye kurenza imirongo 100.000.

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:25.300
Imirongo ibihumbi ijana irahagije kugira ngo yuzuze ibitabo makumyabiri.

00:00:26.870 --> 00:00:29.560
Kwandika kode ndende ntibivuze ko byarangiye.

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:32.540
Ugomba gukomeza gukosora kode wanditse.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.800
Iyo ukoze A, B iracika.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:39.130
Nukosora B, A na C bizacika.

00:00:41.090 --> 00:00:44.260
Dukoresheje ikigereranyo, ni nko kuba warafashwe mu mutego wa Rasputica ukarira.

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:46.360
Ushobora kuvuga ko ibintu bisa n'ifarashi.

00:00:47.330 --> 00:00:50.550
Muri iki gihe, uzumva ukeneye gushushanya.

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:55.010
Ariko iyo ugerageje kwandika inyandiko y'igishushanyo mbonera,

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:58.490
Gusobanura ibitekerezo mu mutwe wawe mu buryo bufatika

00:00:58.790 --> 00:01:01.260
Uzasanga atari byoroshye nkuko ubyibwira.

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:05.600
Ndetse n'umuziki w'urupapuro, ari wo nyandiko ifata amajwi cyangwa umuziki mu buryo bw'amashusho,

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:06.700
Biragoye cyane

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:10.610
Si umuziki gusa, ahubwo n'imari n'ibikoresho

00:01:10.610 --> 00:01:14.060
Ibitekerezo byinshi bitandukanye n'ibisabwa n'abakoresha mu buryo bufatika

00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:17.220
Ntibizaba byoroshye kubigaragaza mu buryo bwihariye.

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:19.490
Ku bw'amahirwe

00:01:19.770 --> 00:01:23.200
Kugira ngo dutsinde ingorane zo kugaragaza ibitekerezo bifatika

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:26.860
UML yavutse mu mpera z'imyaka ya 1990.

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:30.120
Yayobowe na Grady Butch.

00:01:31.460 --> 00:01:34.390
Dukoresha UML dutegereje

00:01:34.980 --> 00:01:36.990
Shushanya igishushanyo mbonera cy'ishuri

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:38.760
Reka kandi dushushanye igishushanyo mbonera cy'uruhererekane

00:01:39.430 --> 00:01:39.980
icyakora

00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:43.160
Ubwo nageragezaga kuyishushanya, byari bitandukanye no kuyishyiraho inyandiko mu buryo butaziguye.

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:45.130
Bisa nkaho bitatandukanye cyane

00:01:45.590 --> 00:01:46.520
Kuki ari uko bimeze?

00:01:47.350 --> 00:01:50.910
Ibyo biterwa nuko inzira yo gutekereza isanzwe ikoreshwa mu gushyira mu bikorwa.

00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:54.170
Aho kugira ngo ibitekerezo bidafatika birusheho kuba bifatika,

00:01:54.490 --> 00:01:57.590
Kubera ko bihindura imitekerereze yo mu rwego rwo gushyira mu bikorwa muri UML.

00:01:58.520 --> 00:02:00.270
Kubera ko ushobora gusoma indirimbo z'urupapuro

00:02:00.270 --> 00:02:01.950
Si uko nshobora kuyihimba

00:02:02.390 --> 00:02:03.850
Kubera ko wize UML gusa

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:06.170
Si nk'aho uteza imbere ubuhanga bwo gushushanya.

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:09.300
Muri uru rukurikirane rero

00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:11.580
Binyuze mu mishinga nyayo

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:14.420
Uburyo bwo gushushanya ibisabwa mu buryo bw'incamake

00:02:14.420 --> 00:02:16.290
Ushobora guhuza kode?

00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:18.010
Ndashaka kukwereka imbonankubone

00:02:18.530 --> 00:02:20.930
Nahisemo kubika amatike ya filime hakurikijwe domaine

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:25.200
Gusaba amatike yo kureba filime biroroshye kubyumva kuko ahanini ari ahantu hazwi cyane.

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:29.710
Harimo imirimo itandukanye nko kwinjira, kwishyura, no guhitamo imyanya.

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:31.580
Bisa nkaho ari urugero rwiza

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:36.890
Muri make, insanganyamatsiko y'iyi nkuru ni igishushanyo mbonera cya porogaramu, ariko

00:02:36.890 --> 00:02:40.350
Tuzaganira kandi ku iterambere rishingiye ku igeragezwa.

00:02:41.210 --> 00:02:44.890
Imiterere y'iterambere rya none ishyigikira ibikoresho byo gupima.

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:48.320
Nubwo wareba imishinga izwi cyane ifunguye,

00:02:48.320 --> 00:02:51.130
Dufite urwego runaka rw'ibizamini.

00:02:51.740 --> 00:02:56.200
Ibi bishobora kuba bivuze ko ibizamini ari ingenzi cyane kandi bifite akamaro.

00:02:56.870 --> 00:02:58.120
Ariko mu by'ukuri

00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:02.590
Mu bihe byinshi, si TDD gusa, ahubwo no mu buryo bwikora bwo gusuzuma imikorere ntibwashyirwa mu bikorwa neza.

00:03:03.190 --> 00:03:06.260
Kwandika ibizamini bifite ishingiro mbere nta kwitegura ni

00:03:06.260 --> 00:03:07.540
Ntibijya byoroha na gato

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:12.340
Iki ni ikintu gisaba ubushobozi bwo gushushanya porogaramu hamwe.

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:16.270
Rero, ni byiza gukorana n'igishushanyo mbonera na TDD.

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:18.180
Nasanze ari ingirakamaro

00:03:20.120 --> 00:03:23.450
Noneho reka dutangire inama ya mbere y'umushinga.

00:03:24.150 --> 00:03:26.470
Kubera ko uyu ari umushinga muto

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:28.090
Hari abitabiriye babiri

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:32.340
Uwuri ibumoso ni inzobere mu by’ikoranabuhanga, naho iburyo ni umuhanga mu by’ikoranabuhanga.

00:03:34.550 --> 00:03:37.790
Impuguke mu by’ikoranabuhanga zifite ijambo muri sisitemu tugomba kubaka.

00:03:37.790 --> 00:03:39.280
Ivuga inkuru nyinshi

00:03:40.340 --> 00:03:42.160
Ikinamico dukoresha

00:03:42.160 --> 00:03:44.710
Hari abagera ku bihumbi bine mu gihugu hose.

00:03:44.710 --> 00:03:47.220
Bishobora kwiyongera kurushaho mu gihe kizaza.

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:50.480
Ubu, uburyo bwo gufatira amatike ya sinema ni bwo bwonyine bushyigikiwe.

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:54.510
Turateganya kongeramo kugurisha amatike ku bitaramo binini nyuma.

00:03:54.510 --> 00:03:58.940
Kandi icy'ingenzi ni uko utagomba na rimwe gukuba imyanya ibiri.

00:03:58.940 --> 00:04:03.250
Mu bihe byashize, ibigo bitanga serivisi ku bakiliya byagorwaga cyane n'ubwo bwoko bw'ikibazo.

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:07.670
Kubera ko hari amakuru menshi ya filime n'amakuru y'isuzuma yamaze gukusanywa.

00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:11.090
Aya makuru agomba kuguma ari yose.

00:04:12.090 --> 00:04:14.730
Aha ngaha ikiganiro cyateguwe neza, ariko

00:04:14.890 --> 00:04:16.960
Mu by'ukuri, hari amakuru menshi

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:18.600
Bizatangwa mu buryo butari bwo

00:04:19.470 --> 00:04:22.110
Ariko inkuru isohoka mu ntangiriro z'umushinga ni

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:23.780
Kubera ko ari cyo gisabwa cy'ingenzi cyane

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:25.320
Ugomba gutega amatwi witonze

00:04:27.110 --> 00:04:29.810
Abakora porogaramu bumva abahanga mu by'ikoranabuhanga

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:31.290
Mfite ibibazo bike

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:34.660
Igikorwa cyo gukusanya amatike y'ibitaramo byinshi wavuze

00:04:34.660 --> 00:04:36.910
Bizongerwaho ryari?

00:04:36.910 --> 00:04:39.910
Ese ibi bigomba gushyirwa mu bikorwa by'uyu mushinga mbere y'igihe?

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:43.590
Cyangwa ndifuza kumenya niba nkwiye kubitekerezaho

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:46.090
Kandi hakenewe kubungabunga amakuru asanzweho

00:04:46.090 --> 00:04:48.940
Ese ibi bivuze ko tudakwiye guhindura sisitemu ya DB?

00:04:48.940 --> 00:04:51.950
Ese hari izindi serivisi zisangiye DB muri iki gihe?

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:54.980
Nkuko mubibona muri DB,

00:04:54.980 --> 00:04:57.290
Kubera ko abahanga mu bya domaine atari abakora porogaramu.

00:04:57.290 --> 00:04:59.430
Imvugo ya tekiniki irasobanutse neza

00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:02.890
Abashinzwe iterambere bagomba kugenzura ibi bintu neza.

00:05:04.230 --> 00:05:07.450
Impuguke mu by’ikoranabuhanga zisubiza ibibazo by’abakora porogaramu nk’ibi:

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:10.210
Igikorwa cyo gukusanya amatike y'ibitaramo ku rwego runini

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:13.450
Nta gahunda yihariye irahari kugeza ubu.

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:15.970
Ariko, iyo ibintu byongewemo mu gihe kizaza

00:05:15.970 --> 00:05:18.700
Kugira ngo ubashe kuvugurura nta ngorane nyinshi

00:05:18.700 --> 00:05:22.600
Ndatekereza ko byaba byiza uramutse ubitekerejeho kuri iyi nshuro.

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:27.050
Nta kindi dukoresha DB kitari serivisi zacu.

00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:32.840
Guhindura sisitemu ubwabyo si ikibazo gikomeye igihe cyose amakuru abungabunzwe neza.

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:35.080
Nyuma yo kumva inkuru

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:39.400
Ndatekereza ko nta mpamvu yo guhangayikishwa n'igitaramo kinini.

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:40.790
Ntabwo ari cyo gikorwa cy'umushinga

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:43.040
Ibisabwa nabyo ntibisobanutse neza

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:44.930
Sinzi igihe nzabikenera, ariko

00:05:44.930 --> 00:05:47.710
Icyo ni ikibazo tugomba kongera gusuzuma nyuma.

00:05:48.920 --> 00:05:50.910
Nubwo bitanditswe mu nyandiko

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:54.880
Impuguke mu bijyanye n'urubuga zizatanga igisubizo cy'uko zizasuzuma imikorere minini.

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:55.960
Ntugomba kwibagirwa

00:05:56.740 --> 00:05:58.320
Nibyo

00:05:58.320 --> 00:06:00.630
Hanyuma, akazi ko gukusanya amatike y'ibitaramo ku rwego runini

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:04.500
Sinabishyira mu by'ingenzi kuri uyu mushinga.

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:08.220
Ahubwo, byoroshya kwagura imikorere nyuma mu gikorwa cyo guteza imbere.

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:10.190
Nzabyitwaramo neza

00:06:10.190 --> 00:06:12.840
Ntugire ikibazo. Nyizere gusa

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:15.960
Ni ngombwa kubana neza

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:19.500
Binyuze mu kiganiro cyacu kugeza ubu

00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:22.700
Ibyihutirwa cyane ni ibi bikurikira:

00:06:23.220 --> 00:06:25.890
Aya ni amakuru atangwa n'impuguke mu bijyanye n'urubuga.

00:06:25.890 --> 00:06:28.410
Gusobanura no gutunganya ibintu ukurikije uko umuhanga mu by'ubwubatsi abibona

00:06:28.410 --> 00:06:29.810
Tangira umushinga

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:32.860
Hamwe n'inzobere mu by'imbuga

00:06:32.860 --> 00:06:34.980
Umaze gufata icyemezo ku ntego z'umushinga wawe,

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:37.980
Noneho igihe kirageze cyo kwita umushinga wawe izina.

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:41.840
Banza ubaze impuguke mu bijyanye n'urubuga rwa interineti igitekerezo cyayo.

00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:45.540
Ni irihe zina ngomba kwita umushinga?

00:06:45.540 --> 00:06:47.680
Ni uburyo bwo kubika filime.

00:06:47.680 --> 00:06:50.150
Bite ho kuri sisitemu yo gutanga filime gusa?

00:06:50.150 --> 00:06:51.430
oya, sinshaka

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:53.570
Nzakora ku buryo bunini bw'ibitaramo

00:06:53.570 --> 00:06:56.930
Reka tujye muri sisitemu yo gutanga filime. yego?

00:06:56.930 --> 00:06:58.180
byiza cyane

00:06:58.180 --> 00:06:59.950
Urakoze cyane

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:05.230
Impuguke mu by'ikoranabuhanga zishobora gushaka amazina y'imishinga mu rurimi rw'Igikoreya.

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:07.680
Ariko ukurikije uko umuhanga mu by'ubwubatsi abibona

00:07:07.680 --> 00:07:09.990
Amagambo yose harimo n'amazina y'umushinga

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:12.180
Kubera ko ishyirwa mu bikorwa mu buryo butaziguye muri kode,

00:07:12.600 --> 00:07:15.000
Biroroshye kubisobanura mu Cyongereza niba bishoboka.

00:07:15.540 --> 00:07:19.510
Ni ngombwa ko abakora porogaramu bakurikiza mu buryo buhamye ibyo abahanga mu by'ikoranabuhanga bakeneye, ariko

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:21.430
Urebye umushinga wose

00:07:21.430 --> 00:07:23.930
Dufite kandi inshingano zo kuyobora ibintu mu cyerekezo cyiza.

00:07:25.850 --> 00:07:27.760
Niba warahisemo izina ry'umushinga wawe

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:31.380
Noneho igihe kirageze cyo kumenya abakoresha sisitemu yo kubika amafilimi.

00:07:32.020 --> 00:07:34.940
Birumvikana ko ugomba kubaza impuguke mu bijyanye n'urubuga kugira ngo ikumenyeshe amakuru kuri ibi.

00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:38.740
Kandi dusanga dufite abakiriya n'abayobozi.

00:07:40.820 --> 00:07:43.280
Kimwe mu bintu byoroshye kubura mu ntangiriro z'igishushanyo ni

00:07:43.280 --> 00:07:44.760
Ni ukwishingikiriza ku byo hanze

00:07:45.340 --> 00:07:46.580
Ibikoresho byo hanze ni

00:07:46.580 --> 00:07:49.210
Bishobora kuba ari sisitemu isanzweho,

00:07:49.660 --> 00:07:51.420
Bishobora kuba uburyo bwo kwishyurana

00:07:52.020 --> 00:07:53.670
Iyi sano yo kwishingikiriza ku bandi ni

00:07:53.670 --> 00:07:56.760
Kubera ko bishobora kugira ingaruka zikomeye ku miterere ya sisitemu muri rusange.

00:07:56.950 --> 00:08:00.150
Ni ngombwa kuyimenya hakiri kare bishoboka.

00:08:00.570 --> 00:08:01.240
ku bw'amahirwe

00:08:01.820 --> 00:08:04.990
Ibintu nk'inzira zo kwishyurana na sisitemu zishaje

00:08:05.270 --> 00:08:07.730
Kubera ko isanzwe ikoreshwa muri sisitemu zisanzweho

00:08:07.990 --> 00:08:10.360
Bishobora kumvikana byoroshye cyane

00:08:11.230 --> 00:08:14.410
Kimwe mu bintu byoroshye kwirengagiza mu mibanire y'abantu bafitanye isano ni

00:08:14.410 --> 00:08:16.090
Hari ibintu bituruka hanze y'ibidukikije

00:08:16.900 --> 00:08:19.060
Igihugu cyacu kiri mu gihe kimwe

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:22.430
Mu gihugu gifite ubuso bunini bw'ubutaka, buri kinamico igira igihe cyayo gitandukanye.

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:25.100
Hanyuma Sisitemu yo Gutanga Amafilimi

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:28.900
Ntibishoboka ko bizagerwaho n’ingaruka z’ibidukikije nk’ahantu habera ibihe.

00:08:29.410 --> 00:08:32.760
Ibi bintu ntibigaragara neza keretse ubajije impuguke mu by’urubuga.

00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:33.950
Biroroshye kubura

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:37.610
Impuguke mu by’ikoranabuhanga zikunze kwirengagiza aya makuru.

00:08:37.610 --> 00:08:40.010
Kubera ko ibisobanuro bishobora gusibwa

00:08:41.680 --> 00:08:43.640
Kubera ko isano yo gushingira ku bandi yagaragajwe neza

00:08:43.640 --> 00:08:47.500
Noneho reka twibande ku bintu by'ingenzi bigize sisitemu yo kubika filime.

00:08:48.430 --> 00:08:52.230
Mbere ya byose, ni iki umukiriya akora muri Sisitemu yo Gutanga Amafilimi?

00:08:52.230 --> 00:08:54.230
Reka tubaze abahanga mu bijyanye n'urubuga

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:57.880
Abakiriya bakora iki?

00:08:57.880 --> 00:08:59.970
Abakiriya bashakisha filime,

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:01.450
Reba amakuru arambuye kuri filime,

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:02.910
Hitamo igihe cyo gusuzuma,

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:04.450
Hitamo intebe yawe,

00:09:04.450 --> 00:09:05.920
Gutanga amatike ya filime,

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:07.610
Reba amakuru ajyanye no kubika,

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:10.180
Kora ibintu nko guhagarika igihe cyo kubika

00:09:10.180 --> 00:09:15.750
Ese guhitamo igihe cyo kwerekana no guhitamo umwanya ni kimwe mu bigize gahunda yo gutanga amatike ya sinema?

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:18.880
No kubitsa amatike ya sinema, guhagarika kubitsa

00:09:18.880 --> 00:09:22.210
N'ubundi se, ntabwo ugura itike gusa hanyuma ukabona amafaranga yawe?

00:09:22.210 --> 00:09:23.620
Ufite ukuri

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:25.030
Nibyo koko

00:09:25.480 --> 00:09:27.880
Kubera ko ubu ari domaine isanzwe imenyerewe

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:31.240
Hitamo igihe cyo kwiyerekana hanyuma uhitemo umwanya wawe

00:09:31.240 --> 00:09:33.200
Ese iki ni kimwe mu bigize gahunda yo gukusanya amatike ya sinema?

00:09:33.200 --> 00:09:34.530
Nashoboraga kubaza

00:09:34.980 --> 00:09:37.220
Ariko niba ari domaine itazwi,

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:40.160
Gusesengura buri ngero ry'ikoreshwa mu buryo burambuye

00:09:40.520 --> 00:09:43.330
Uzasubiramo inzira yo gutunganya inshuro nyinshi.

00:09:43.790 --> 00:09:45.350
Bitewe n'uko umushinga umeze

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:48.080
Ushobora gusubiramo iki gikorwa inshuro nyinshi,

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:50.580
Uko urushaho gufata umwanya wawe no gusesengura witonze,

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:54.190
Gabanya igerageza n'amakosa mu gihe cyo gushushanya no gushyira mu bikorwa.

00:09:55.850 --> 00:09:57.530
Hashingiwe ku kiganiro cyatanzwe kugeza ubu

00:09:57.530 --> 00:10:00.970
Twashyize hamwe uburyo abakiriya bacu bakoresha mu byiciro bine:

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:04.470
Ukurikiraho ni umuyobozi

00:10:05.190 --> 00:10:08.850
Umuyobozi ashobora kubona ko hari ibintu bitanu by'ubuyobozi:

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:13.620
Ku giti cyanjye, nditondera gukoresha ijambo "Gucunga" mu iterambere.

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:16.980
Gucunga ni imvugo yagutse cyane

00:10:16.980 --> 00:10:19.030
Ntabwo birasobanutse neza icyo urimo gukora

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:20.950
Ni kimwe n'aha hantu

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:23.760
Bicungwa bite neza neza?

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:24.810
Simbizi

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:27.620
Mu kuganira n'inzobere mu by'imbuga

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:31.220
Buri kintu cyo gucunga cyaguwe kugira ngo gikoreshwe mu buryo bwihariye.

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:33.660
Niba ari umushinga nyakuri

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:35.890
Birashoboka ko hari uburyo bwinshi bwo gukoresha kurusha ubu.

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:39.000
Aha nabyorohereje kugira ngo bisobanuke.

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:42.700
Icy'ingenzi kumenya hano ni uko iyo ushyizeho igihe cyo gukora,

00:10:43.020 --> 00:10:45.900
Urabona ko itike nayo yakozwe

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:49.200
Kandi iyo uguze cyangwa usubiza amafaranga y'itike

00:10:49.490 --> 00:10:53.910
Urashobora kandi kubona ko dukoresha serivisi yo hanze yitwa inzira yo kwishyura.

00:10:55.890 --> 00:10:58.670
Nahuje ikoreshwa ry'abakiriya n'abayobozi.

00:10:59.350 --> 00:11:01.730
Urebye ikoreshwa ryose nk'iri

00:11:01.730 --> 00:11:02.900
Hari ikintu gisa n'aho kirimo ubusa

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:05.840
Hari amahitamo yo kongeramo ikinamico

00:11:05.840 --> 00:11:08.720
Nta kintu na kimwe mbona nka Search Theater

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:12.130
Bisa nkaho hari uburyo bwinshi bwo gukoresha burimo gusibwa.

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:15.980
Kubera ko ukurikije uko impuguke mu by'ibanga rihagaze, hari byinshi byo gusobanura.

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:17.950
Uru rugero rw'ikoreshwa, rusa n'aho rugaragara cyane,

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:19.810
Ushobora gukuramo ibisobanuro

00:11:20.770 --> 00:11:23.460
None se ukurikije uko umuhanga mu by'ikoranabuhanga abibona, bite?

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:28.290
Ni byiza kwirengagiza inkuru zoroheje nko gushakisha ikinamico.

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:30.700
Ese ibi ntibyaba ari ingirakamaro kurushaho mu gucunga inyandiko?

00:11:31.720 --> 00:11:32.870
Niba ari igishushanyo mbonera cy'inyuma

00:11:32.870 --> 00:11:35.920
Uburyo bworoshye bwo gukoresha nko gushakisha ikinamico

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:37.760
Ndatekereza ko nta kibazo kubyirengagiza

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:41.570
Icyo mvuga ni uko bitarakererwa kugira ngo umuntu asubize mu gihe cyo gushyira mu bikorwa.

00:11:42.370 --> 00:11:44.310
Ariko niba ari umushinga nyakuri

00:11:44.310 --> 00:11:48.450
Ku bategura porogaramu, izi ngero zo gukoresha ni ahantu heza ho gutangirira.

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:52.300
Umutegura yarebye uko ibintu byakoreshejwe mu gushakisha ikinamico.

00:11:52.300 --> 00:11:55.300
Nigute nakora ibishoboka byose kugira ngo nshobore gushakisha amasinema?

00:11:55.300 --> 00:11:56.600
Uzashobora gutekereza

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:00.880
Iyo uhuje ibishushanyo mbonera mu kimwe, bisa nkaho bigoye.

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:05.150
Iyo biba umushinga nyakuri, byari kuba bigoye cyane.

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:08.240
Muri iki gihe, nta mpamvu yo gushyira ku ngufu guhuza.

00:12:08.810 --> 00:12:13.910
Nabihuje hano kugira ngo nerekane ko hari ababura.

00:12:16.020 --> 00:12:18.490
Narangije imanza zose zabuze

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:21.880
Mfite ikibazo cyo gukoresha aho isano iri hagati yanjye n'umukinnyi idahari.

00:12:22.290 --> 00:12:25.720
Ibi bireba abakiriya ndetse n'abayobozi.

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:29.480
Kandi kugira ngo byorohere gushyira mu bikorwa, nabyanditse mu Cyongereza.

00:12:31.370 --> 00:12:34.160
Ubu nta kibazo kuko ari umushinga muto

00:12:34.160 --> 00:12:36.160
Niba umushinga ari munini kandi ugoye

00:12:36.160 --> 00:12:38.980
Impuguke mu by'amakuru (domaine) igomba gutangirira he gusobanura?

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:40.380
Bishobora kugorana

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:43.300
Umuyobozi akora iki?

00:12:43.300 --> 00:12:44.700
Ni akazi kenshi

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:46.620
Nkuko byari byitezwe n'umuyobozi

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:49.750
Muri iki gihe, dushobora kugabanya abakinnyi?

00:12:49.750 --> 00:12:52.340
Ni byiza kandi gusuzuma

00:12:53.140 --> 00:12:54.790
Mbere na mbere banyitaga umuyobozi

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:57.400
Birashoboka ko umuntu yagabanyijemo ibice bitewe n'uruhare

00:12:58.520 --> 00:13:00.820
No gukoresha sisitemu yo kubika filime

00:13:00.820 --> 00:13:02.870
Hashobora kuba hari serivisi zo hanze

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:05.340
Iyo tugabanyije abakinnyi mu byiciro gutya,

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:09.420
Impuguke mu by'ikoranabuhanga zizashobora gutanga amakuru arambuye kuri gahunda.

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:14.000
Birumvikana ko uru ari urugero rumwe gusa rwo gusesengura urwego rugoye.

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:17.320
Hashobora kubaho ubundi buryo bwiza

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:21.740
Ni ngombwa gusubiza mu buryo bworoshye bitewe n'imimerere.

00:13:24.250 --> 00:13:25.060
Uyu ni wo mwanzuro

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:29.170
Kuri iyi nshuro, tuzakoresha igishushanyo mbonera cy'ikoreshwa

00:13:29.170 --> 00:13:30.840
Shyiraho intego z'umushinga

00:13:31.230 --> 00:13:33.700
Nanyuze mu byiciro bya mbere by'isesengura.

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:38.010
Ku giti cyanjye, mu gihe cyose cy'iterambere

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:40.060
Ndatekereza ko isesengura ari ryo rigoye cyane

00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:44.250
Kubera ko tugomba gutunganya ibitekerezo bidafite ishingiro kandi bidasobanutse neza.

00:13:45.020 --> 00:13:47.650
Ubutaha tuzareba uburyo bw'ingenzi bwo gukoresha

00:13:47.650 --> 00:13:49.470
Reka tubisesengure birambuye

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:52.100
Urakoze ku bw'umuhate wakoze kugeza ubu.

